  "rows": [
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "どうして彩に渡された手紙だけ、こんなに古ぼけて\nボロボロなのかしら？　他の事務所は違ったわよね。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "華村 翔真"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_05_b:step-4:text",
        "step_id": 4,
        "step_index": 3,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_05_b",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_05_b.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 17,
          "target_step_index": 3
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "ええ。『スピード部門』の時のように、\n手違いがないかスタッフに確認したのですが……。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "producer",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "<P>"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": false,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_05_b:step-5:text",
        "step_id": 5,
        "step_index": 4,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_05_b",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_05_b.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 17,
          "target_step_index": 4
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "向こうは「これで合ってる」って言ってたんでしょ？\nふうん……きな臭いことが続くもんだ。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "華村 翔真"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_05_b:step-6:text",
        "step_id": 6,
        "step_index": 5,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_05_b",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_05_b.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 17,
          "target_step_index": 5
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "●●●●プロデューサークン！\nあっちにお土産屋があるでにゃんすよ！",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "猫柳 キリオ"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_05_b:step-9:text",
        "step_id": 9,
        "step_index": 8,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_05_b",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_05_b.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 17,
          "target_step_index": 8
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "あら、いいわね♪\nちょいと寄っていこうじゃない。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "華村 翔真"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_05_b:step-10:text",
        "step_id": 10,
        "step_index": 9,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_05_b",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_05_b.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 17,
          "target_step_index": 9
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "事務所のみんなに、お土産も買いたいし。\n●●●●プロデューサーちゃん、行きましょ♪",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "華村 翔真"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_05_b:step-11:text",
        "step_id": 11,
        "step_index": 10,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_05_b",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_05_b.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 17,
          "target_step_index": 10
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "お土産探しも、あくまで仕事のためですよね？\nあまりハメを外すようなことは……。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "清澄 九郎"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_05_b:step-12:text",
        "step_id": 12,
        "step_index": 11,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_05_b",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_05_b.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 17,
          "target_step_index": 11
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "とかなんとか言って、九郎ちゃん。地元の鎌倉に\n興味を持ってもらえて嬉しいのが隠せてないわよォ？",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "華村 翔真"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_05_b:step-13:text",
        "step_id": 13,
        "step_index": 12,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_05_b",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_05_b.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 17,
          "target_step_index": 12
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "なんだかんだ言いながら、\n食べ歩きにも付き合ってくれたじゃないか。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "華村 翔真"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_05_b:step-14:text",
        "step_id": 14,
        "step_index": 13,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_05_b",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_05_b.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 17,
          "target_step_index": 13
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "おいしいお煎餅のお店もそふとくりぃむのお店も、\nくろークンが教えてくれたでにゃんす～！",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "猫柳 キリオ"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_05_b:step-15:text",
        "step_id": 15,
        "step_index": 14,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_05_b",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_05_b.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 17,
          "target_step_index": 14
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "そ、それはあくまで、\nこの土地に対する理解を深めていただくためで……。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "清澄 九郎"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_05_b:step-16:text",
        "step_id": 16,
        "step_index": 15,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_05_b",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_05_b.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 17,
          "target_step_index": 15
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "ですが、事務所のみなさんにお土産を買うのは\n賛成です。あのお店でしたら案内しましょう。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "清澄 九郎"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_05_b:step-17:text",
        "step_id": 17,
        "step_index": 16,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_05_b",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
